r\"><strong>MIM number</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ollier disease</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 178.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"238\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Unilateral predominance</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">I</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Sporadic: somatic mosaic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em style=\"\">IDH1</em>, <em style=\"\">IDH2</em> (<em style=\"\">PTH1R</em>)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 80.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"107\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{22057234; 22057236}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">166000</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Maffucci syndrome</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 178.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"238\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Same as Ollier disease, with haemangioma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">II</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Sporadic: somatic mosaic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em style=\"\">IDH1</em>, <em style=\"\">IDH2</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 80.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"107\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{22057234; 22057236}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">614569</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">MC-HGA</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 178.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"238\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Severe metaphyseal lesions, mild vertebral involvement, presence of D-2-HG in the urine, other</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">VI</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Sporadic: somatic mosaic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em style=\"\">IDH1</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 80.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"107\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{22025298}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">614875</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Metachondromatosis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 178.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"238\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Osteochondroma-like lesions (especially in the hands)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">III</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">AD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em style=\"\">PTPN11</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 80.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"107\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{20577567; 21533187}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">156250</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Genochondromatosis types&nbsp;1 and 2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 178.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"238\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Symmetrical lesions, normal stature, type&nbsp;1: thickened clavicles, type&nbsp;2: normal clavicles</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">AD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Unknown</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 80.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"107\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{26174433; 17632779}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">137360</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">SPENCD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 178.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"238\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Metaphyseal dysplasia, platyspondyly, autoimmune disease, neurological dysfunction</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">IV</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">AR</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em style=\"\">ACP5</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 80.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"107\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{21217755; 21217752; 26951490}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">607944</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DSC</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 178.85pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"238\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Metaphyseal enchondromas, anisospondyly and kyphoscoliosis, other</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">VII</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">AD?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em>COL2A1</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 80.05pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"107\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29928178; 22570642}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"76\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">AD, autosomal dom